{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50351","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 四、贰师泉咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 四、贰师泉咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤哉李广利，爲将讨匈奴。\n路指[一三]三危迥，山连万里枯。\n抽刀刺石壁，发矢落金乌。\n志感飞泉涌，能领士马[苏][一四]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}